{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/Modules"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Integrate-OUDS","text":"Integrate OUDS","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Use Swift Package Manager","level":3,"anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to add the iOS library of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}]},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to your "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" project by refering to it by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Import the librairies you need","anchor":"Import-the-librairies-you-need","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" products.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"]},{"anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","level":3,"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","type":"heading"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and useless constants."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" product which suits your needs:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above and all themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Wireframe theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"text":"Chose your theme","type":"heading","anchor":"Chose-your-theme","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}]},{"text":" framework provides today four themes:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Compact"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For Sosh products"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Wireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Apply-a-theme","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Apply a theme"},{"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row","columns":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You will need to use for your application root view the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" also."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme.","type":"text"}]}],"size":1},{"content":[{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"]}],"size":1}]},{"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row","columns":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want.","type":"text"}]}],"size":1},{"content":[{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"]}],"size":1}]},{"style":"tip","name":"Tip","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview","text":"Trick for Xcode Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use Xcode ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Apply Orange theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangePreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Orange Compact theme","#Preview {","    Sampl